<title>CHINA: CHINA'S FITIC SETS US$100M 144A YANKEE BOND.</title>
<headline>CHINA'S FITIC SETS US$100M 144A YANKEE BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by sole bookrunner Merrill Lynch and Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER FUJIAN INTERNATIONAL TRUST &amp; INVESTMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMT   $100 MLN	COUPON     7.375 PCT  MATURITY    25.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE  144A YANKEE   SPREAD     123 BP     PAY DATE    25.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA2     ISS PRICE  99.339*    LAUNCH DATE 07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	REOFFER    99.339     FULL FEES   --</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE     DENOMS (K) 1	    PAY FREQ    SEMI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	CRS DEFLT  YES	  FORCE MAJ   --</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	 HOME CTRY  CHINA</p>
<p>NOTES - * TO YIELD 7.47 PERCENT ANNUALLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6346</p>
